  // to enter its system and see its planets. In Laniakea and the Observable Universe the nearest
  // galaxies are marked; enter one to fly inside it, and on into any of its stars. Beyond the real
  // catalogues these are generated from where they are -- the same spot always gives the same place --
  // with realistic mixes (mostly red dwarfs, most stars with planets, rocky inside the snow line, gas and
