  // ---------------- progression ----------------
  // Modes, colours and ships unlock as you play; saved on this device (spaghettify.progress.v1).
  //  first launch: a tour of the menu, then two minutes watching the computer play the black hole -> BLACKHOLE
  //  3 minutes of Blackhole -> SHIP (pick FLEET or ALIENS; you start with your side's small ship)
  //  your side's Tier 2 built -> that ship + EARTH; Tier 3 built -> that ship + UNIVERSE + the other side's small ship
