  // ======================= the races: where they live, how far they've spread, what they know of each other =======================
  // Four races, each in its own star system: humans (the Solar System), the aliens (Proxima Centauri), the Raiders
  // (Barnard's Star: the Priest's hull and its refits -- the first race to travel to other systems, and the fastest to
  // build ships) and the TRAPPIST-1 race. Lone Blitzers and Stalkers belong to no one. Nobody turns up on top of you:
  // a race's ships are where that race is -- its home, the systems it has spread to, the lanes between them -- mining,
  // travelling, leaving for other levels and arriving from them. None of them knows you: they farm. They fight a race
  // only at war with it: one that fired on them (remembered: they hunt it on sight from then on), or the weakest one
  // they know, once their fleet is strong enough to go after other races' worlds. Races that meet and stay at peace may
  // open a trade route.
  const RACES = ['human', 'alien', 'raider', 'trappist'];
